00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:36.359
(Were you already checking, like, every hour or did you check once a day or?
- Yeh, once a day or something like that. As soon as I

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:40.169
saw the file was there I knew that it had a solution. Of course, then I checked it,

